{"code":"011370","name":"서한","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건설","sector_desc":"주택·토목·플랜트 시공. 부동산 경기, 금리, 해외 수주와 원가율이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1971년 대구주택공사로 설립되어 주택건설과 토목, 건축공사업, 부동산임대업을 영위하는 종합 건설업체로 1994년 코스닥시장에 상장되었음. 사업은 건축, 토목, 분양, 기타로 구분하며 분양공사가 매출의 49.1% 차지하고 관급공사를 주력으로 하고 있음. 신기술을 통해 공간활용의 편리성과 유용성을 추구하며 지역 최초 턴키공사 수주로 건설기술을 선도하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":5040.0,"open":3835.0,"high":5040.0,"low":3790.0,"volume":2477543,"amount":12486816720.0,"ret_1d":31.5927,"gap":0.1305,"range_pct":24.8016,"ret_5":35.8491,"ret_20":36.0324,"ret_60":28.4076,"ret_120":-7.1823,"ret_250":10.1639,"ma20":3799.0,"ma60":3827.8333,"ma120":4152.0,"ma200":4470.8,"close_vs_ma200":12.7315,"close_vs_ma60":31.6672,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":1.0,"slope_60":3.0074,"r2_60":0.002,"slope_120":-48.4276,"r2_120":0.6033,"slope_250":-20.9233,"r2_250":0.2907,"high52":6190.0,"low52":3335.0,"pos_52w":59.7198,"dd_52w":-18.5784,"mdd_1y":-42.3172,"atr14_pct":6.2146,"vol_ann_60":71.1005,"vol_avg20":178620.8,"vol_ratio20":13.8704,"vr5":20.2233,"vr20":3.0382,"amount_avg5":3117493303.0,"amount_avg20":834088322.0,"amount_avg60":374039864.3333,"obv_chg20":68.2401,"turnover_20":17.7037,"pv_eff_20":2.0353,"rsi14":81.5223,"frgn_net_5":-57372.0,"inst_net_5":36738.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.2843,"inst_net_5_pct":0.1821,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.1023,"frgn_net_20":-69079.0,"inst_net_20":36738.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.3423,"inst_net_20_pct":0.1821,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.1603,"frgn_net_60":184662.0,"inst_net_60":8977.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.9151,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0445,"smart_net_60_pct":0.9596,"frgn_net_120":-484563.0,"inst_net_120":59880.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-2.4013,"inst_net_120_pct":0.2967,"smart_net_120_pct":-2.1046,"foreign_ratio":3.73,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.55,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":223.0,"op_margin_q":15.1084,"op_qoq":259.6774,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-34.2183,"rev_yoy":-25.5298,"op_trend_4q":40.3922,"fin_period":"202606","roe":3.46,"debt_ratio":127.09,"per":5.34,"pbr":0.18,"di